[428.492644, "o", "\u001b[35m\r\n(!) Launch the URL below in the browser if it hasn't been open already to create your first superuser account:\r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[1;36mhttp://0.0.0.0:8090/_/#/pbinstal/REDACTED\u001b[22;0m\r\n\u001b[90;3m(you can also create your first superuser by running: ./server superuser upsert EMAIL PASS)\r\n\r\n\u001b[0m"]
